## Phase 4 — Scientific Validation Suite (Week 5-7)

### Benchmark 1: Campaign Reconstruction
Take 5 real luxury campaign images. Feed the product description. Compare the system's Creative State decisions against the real campaign's actual lighting/camera/grading.

### Benchmark 2: Objective Variance
Single saree → 4 Creative Objectives (Catalog, Bridal, Editorial, UGC). Human judges score appropriateness.

### Benchmark 3: A/B Test
Prompt-only workflow vs. Creative Intelligence workflow. Measure Product Fidelity, Luxury Perception, Consistency, Human Preference.

### Correction #6: Benchmark 4 — Consistency (NEW)
One saree → generate 20 images → can experts confirm it's the same product across all 20? This is the core promise of the platform. Measure it.

### Correction #7: Business Metrics Dashboard

| Metric | How it's measured |
|---|---|---|
| Product Fidelity | Can a merchant identify the product? (1-10) |
| Brand Fidelity | Does it match the positioning? (1-10) |
| Visual Realism | Can photographers tell it's AI? (blind test %) |
| Commercial Utility | Would a brand publish this? (yes/no + confidence) |
| Edit Distance | Minutes of manual editing before approval |
| Approval Rate | % of assets approved on first attempt |
| **Product Identity Consistency** | Same product recognizable across 20 images? (%) |
| **Color Consistency** | Color fidelity across campaign assets (%) |
| **Embroidery Consistency** | Detail preservation across angles/crops (%) |
| **Brand Consistency** | Visual language alignment across campaign (%) |

